  "description": "Set on the top floor, this refurbished, unfurnished apartment at 31/12 McMaster Street offers an exceptional lifestyle with sweeping panoramic views, modern finishes and outstanding inner city convenience. <br/><br/>With no one above you, the apartment enjoys a wonderful sense of privacy and elevation, with a spectacular outlook spanning Crown Perth, Optus Stadium, Perth City and across to the treetops of Kings Park.<br/><br/>A Closer Look:<br/>* Top floor apartment positioned on the third level with no one above<br/>* Sweeping panoramic views across Crown Perth, Optus Stadium, Perth City and Kings Park<br/>* Tastefully refurbished throughout with a sleek, modern feel<br/>* Remodelled kitchen with overhead cabinetry and generous bench space<br/>* Quality appliances including an oven, dishwasher <br/>* Combined bathroom and laundry with built-in washing machine<br/>* Split system reverse cycle air-conditioning unit<br/>* Covered parking bay included<br/>* Well maintained low rise complex <br/>* Secure front vehicle access plus rear pedestrian and vehicle gates<br/>* Fully fenced secure communal pool area<br/><br/>The Neighbourhood Perks:<br/>* Moments from the vibrant Albany Highway café and dining strip<br/>* Surrounded by restaurants, bars, boutique shops and local amenities<br/>* Easy access to public transport<br/>* Close to Perth CBD, the Swan River and nearby parks<br/>* Convenient to Crown Perth and Optus Stadium<br/>* Sought after Victoria Park location offering lifestyle and connectivity<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE: The property listing may contain images which show furniture in the property, which may or may not be digitally staged. Prospective tenants must be aware that the property is being leased unfurnished.<br/><br/>12+ month lease preferred<br/><br/>AVAILABLE 23 JUNE 2026<br/><br/>Send your enquiry through today to arrange an appointment to view. Please ensure you are registered for any viewings to allow us to keep you updated of any changes.",
